00:01:06.469 --> 00:01:13.100
bit on the lower end, and that ties the lowest
approval of 2019 so is this some kind of breaking

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:19.270
news that changes everything? Trump approval
at 36 well, not in the sense that Trump is

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:22.799
in the middle of the approval range that he's
